#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ksame; is a simple game. It is played by one player, so there is only one "
"winner :-) You play for fun and against the high score. It has been inspired "
"by SameGame, which is only really famous on the Macintosh."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In 1997 &Stephan.Kulow; and Marcus Kreutzberger wrote <foreignphrase lang="
"\"de\">Probiere</foreignphrase> (a German pun). It was their first attempt "
"to write a X11 application. They decided that it would be a good idea to "
"port it to &kde;, and here we are."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &ksame;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A very simple premise. There are a bunch of marbles. Get rid of them all. ;-)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can erase same marbles when they are connected vertically or "
"horizontally when you click them. If there are pieces over the erased ones, "
"they will drop down. If all of the pieces on the vertical line are erased, "
"all pieces on the right side will slide to the left."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "The score is calculated as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Subtract 2 from the number of marbles erased, and square the result."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As an example, if you erase 7 balls, then you get 25 points (7 minus 2 = 5. "
"5 squared is 25 points).If you erase 8 balls, then you get 36 points (8 "
"minus 2 = 6. 6 squared is 36 points."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Get as many of the same pieces as you can, and then erase them in one click. "
"That way you will get a higher score. The game is over when there are no "
"pieces that can be erased."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The score will then be decreased according to the number of remaining "
"pieces. If you erase all pieces 1,000 bonus points will be added to the "
"final score."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "More &ksame; Features"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ksame; is wonderful in that it will allow you to kill 5 minutes while you "
"wait for that program to compile."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Or, if nothing else, it will allow you to kill 5 minutes."
msgstr ""

